NOTICE — Kingmaker v0.4.1 space-cell

The modules in this directory (lib/space-client.mjs, lib/cell-governor.mjs)
form a client and governance layer for the SPACE sandbox platform:

    SPACE — Sandboxed Platform for Agentic Code Execution
    Copyright the SPACE authors (Perplexity)
    https://github.com/perplexityai/SPACE
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

SPACE itself is NOT vendored here and is never shipped in the Kingmaker
payload: it runs as external infrastructure on the operator's Linux host,
and this code speaks to it over its public HTTP API, whose shape was taken
from SPACE's documentation and reference example. No SPACE code is copied
into these modules.

The audit-chain module (lib/audit-chain.mjs) is Kingmaker's own house
pattern, copied from router-phase2/lib/audit-chain.mjs.

One workload kind in the governor registry, 'kuroko-voice', fronts an
external engine that is likewise never linked or shipped:

    Voice Studio — Copyright DebPalash and contributors
    https://github.com/debpalash/VoiceStudio
    Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)

Voice Studio is driven by subprocess/API from inside the cell only,
under the AGPL external-tool rule recorded in the registry entry.
